Spend Marks of Deeds to designate your Tactic and increase your Heraldry rank.

You can earn Marks of Deeds for:

- completing Guild Pledges (daily);

- winning a Training Dominion (weekly);

- participating in a Guild Dominion;

- participating in a Champion Dominion;

- participating in Misty Glade battles.

Heraldry rank define your Tactics and Guild Accessories. The maximum rank is 8. The Heraldry rank directly depends on your Guild Prestige level:

Rank 1: level 15;

Rank 2: level 25;

Rank 3: level 35;

Rank 4: level 45;

Rank 5: level 60;

Rank 6: level 75;

Rank 7: level 90;

Rank 8: level 100.

To pass on to the next rank, you'll need to invest some Marks of Deeds and gold.

There's still a lot we don't know about Keepers. We know that it can evolve. Here are the daily requirements:

150 Dim Sparks from the Kingdom of Elements;

50 Sparks from Heroic Adventures;

135 Radiant Sparks from raid adventures at the Observatory;

300 portions of Mount Feed from the Boutique;

50 Crystal Soul Shards from the Boutique.

I wish I could show you how to feed it, but I can't. But I promise, if you do this, it's going to be quick.

Both the Stronghold Keeper and guild members on headhunting duty can earn coins. That's right! I can pay you daily for the following resources:

120 Small Monster Heads from the Stronghold;

50 large monster heads from the Stronghold;

5 dangerous monster heads from the Stronghold;

1 June Reactor from the Stronghold's Golem Sentry

Paying for the whole package! No loans, no delayed payments. You give me goods, I give you money, plain and simple.

"We lost the astral monster only near the allod's shores. It's alright, we've still got our loot! We spent half a day taking stock. Here's what we have:

- canned meat, 124;

- crystal shards, different sizes, 22;

- large Astral Azurite, {num1};

- mana batteries, 11."

My dear sister! The wind and the road are calling me. I can't believe this day has come, but I'll be on my way tomorrow. I've always been a strange centaur. Our village is too small for me. I made up my mind. I want to travel, visit places, see the miracles and wonders of the world. Who knows, we might meet again some day. For what it's worth, don't be sad. I'd suffer here if I stayed.

P.S.: Don't worry about me, I'm not careless. I prepared for the long journey!

Here's my checklist:

An extra four of boots;

A bundle of food I picked up in the camp (no idea how long it will keep, though);

An axe. What would I be without it?

My favorite toy centaur (mini me);

A bunch of stuff for the road.

If you wonder where I'll go first, it's the Well of Souls. They say it's the most amazing place on Ammer! I don't know what it is, but that makes it better! Maybe I'll write a song.

Alright, it's taking too long. I'm going to bed, I've got an early morning tomorrow.

I'm busy... Since muses are benevolent today, I have come up with something:

What troubles you?

Tell me! Is it love tormenting your heart?

Who are they? Who will I seduce?

Who will it be?

A recent runaway is here to stay;

Who shunned the gift will come bearing gifts;

Who loves today will love once more;

But it will be unrequited...
